   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical cooperation with the bar association of Bosnia-Herzegovine BARS, phase I. The purpose of the project is to assist BARS in the transition into a modern bar association in accordance with  international standards and offering professional services to its members. Swedish counterpart= Swedish Institute for Legal Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tekniskt samarbete med Bosnienserbiska Advokatsamfundet BARS &#xE5;r 2000, fas I. Projektets syfte &#xE4;r att assistera BARS i transitionen till ett modernt advokatsamfund i samklang med internationell standard, och att erbjuda professionell service/st&#xF6;d till dess medlemmar. Svensk samarbetspart &#xE4;r Swedish Institute for Legal Development.</narrative>
